    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently it is  possible to add and remove triples via PUT, POST and PATCH with predicates in the memento:* namespace.  The task here is to ensure that these requests are rejected.  Furthermore, some effort should go consolidating how SMTs are validated.",
